---
import {
  FaCheckCircle,
  FaMicroscope,
  FaBullseye,
  FaHandshake,
  FaHeart,
  FaBolt,
  FaShieldAlt,
  FaUserMd,
  FaHome,
  FaStar,
  FaFlask,
  FaRocket,
} from "react-icons/fa"
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro"

const coreValues = [
  {
    title: "Excellence",
    Icon: FaMicroscope,
    desc: "Delivering world-class diagnostics without compromise.",
  },
  {
    title: "Accuracy",
    Icon: FaBullseye,
    desc: "Every result is precise, reliable, and trustworthy.",
  },
  {
    title: "Integrity",
    Icon: FaHandshake,
    desc: "Honest, ethical, and confidential—always.",
  },
  {
    title: "Compassion",
    Icon: FaHeart,
    desc: "Caring for every client with dignity and respect.",
  },
  {
    title: "Timeliness",
    Icon: FaBolt,
    desc: "Fast turnaround without compromising quality.",
  },
  {
    title: "Quality & Safety",
    Icon: FaShieldAlt,
    desc: "Quality systems ensuring safe, dependable laboratory services.",
  },
  {
    title: "Innovation",
    Icon: FaFlask,
    desc: "Advancing diagnostics through cutting-edge technology.",
  },
  {
    title: "Expertise",
    Icon: FaUserMd,
    desc: "Experienced specialists delivering trusted diagnostic excellence.",
  },
  {
    title: "Convenience",
    Icon: FaHome,
    desc: "Home and office sample collection at your convenience.",
  },
  {
    title: "Customer Focus",
    Icon: FaStar,
    desc: "Your health, comfort, and satisfaction come first.",
  },
]

const whoWeWorkWith = [
  "Individuals (Members of the public)",
  "Healthcare Providers",
  "Hospitals & Clinics",
  "Corporate Organizations",
  "Public Institutions",
]
---

<Layout>
  <div class="w-full font-sans text-gray-800 bg-white">
    {/* Breadcrumbs */}
    <nav class="bg-gray-50 py-4 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 border-b border-gray-200">
      <ol class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <li>
          <a href="/" class="hover:underline hover:text-[#01329C] transition-colors"> Home </a>
        </li>
        <li>»</li>
        <li class="text-gray-700 font-medium">About Us</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    {/* Hero Section */}
    <section
      class="relative py-20 md:py-28 px-6 text-center border-b border-gray-100 overflow-hidden bg-cover bg-center"
      style="background-image: url('/about-us-background.jpg')"
    >
      {/* Overlay to ensure text readability */}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/40 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-[#01329C] mb-6 tracking-tight">
          About EC-Lab
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 font-medium">
          Delivering accurate, timely, and reliable laboratory results that support better
          healthcare decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Who We Are */}
    <section class="py-16 md:py-24 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#01329C] mb-4">Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            EC-Lab (Express Clinical Laboratory) Ltd is a leading provider of world-class diagnostic
            and pathology services in Nigeria, committed to delivering accurate, timely, and
            reliable laboratory results that support better healthcare decisions and improved
            patient outcomes.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our strength lies in our multidisciplinary team of highly experienced Consultant
            Pathologists, Medical Laboratory Scientists, Molecular Biologists, and Healthcare
            Information Professionals who work together to provide comprehensive diagnostic
            solutions tailored to the needs of individuals, healthcare providers, hospitals,
            corporate organizations, and public institutions.
          </p>
          <p>
            At EC-Lab, quality is at the heart of everything we do. We operate a robust Quality
            Management System and utilize state-of-the-art laboratory equipment, advanced molecular
            technologies, and internationally recognized best practices to ensure precision,
            reliability, and consistency in every test we perform. Our commitment to excellence has
            earned us a reputation for dependable results and exceptional customer service.
          </p>
          <p>
            Beyond laboratory testing, our clients enjoy access to expert pathology consultations
            and professional guidance that help clinicians and patients better understand and
            utilize laboratory findings for optimal healthcare outcomes.
          </p>
          <p>
            We pride ourselves on providing a warm, welcoming, and client-friendly environment where
            every client is treated with professionalism, respect, and compassion. Our dedicated
            staff are always available to guide you through every step of your laboratory
            experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            For your convenience, EC-Lab offers Home and Office Sample Collection Services, bringing
            quality diagnostics directly to your doorstep. Whether at home, in the workplace, or at
            our modern facility, we make healthcare accessible, convenient, and stress-free.
          </p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            When accuracy matters, trust EC-Lab. Visit us today and experience diagnostic excellence
            delivered by experts who care about your health.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:mt-16">
          <img
            src="/lab-girl-testing.png"
            alt="Lab Scientist Testing"
            class="w-full h-80 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300"
          />
          <img
            src="/microscope-lab.png"
            alt="Microscope in Lab"
            class="w-full h-80 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Who We Work With */}
    <section class="bg-[#01329C] text-white py-10 shadow-inner">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-wide">Who we work with</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-y-6 gap-x-12">
        {
          whoWeWorkWith.map((item) => (
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 p-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors duration-200">
              <div class="text-[#01329C] text-2xl shrink-0">
                <FaCheckCircle />
              </div>
              <span class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">{item}</span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Vision & Mission */}
    <section class="bg-[#01329C] text-white py-10 shadow-inner">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-wide">Our Vision & Mission</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 bg-white max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
        <div
          class="bg-blue-50 p-8 md:p-10 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-[#01329C] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
        >
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#01329C] mb-4 flex items-center">
            <div class="mr-3">
              <FaBullseye />
            </div>
            Our Vision
          </h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            To redefine diagnostics through speed, precision, and innovation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-blue-50 p-8 md:p-10 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-[#01329C] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
        >
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#01329C] mb-4 flex items-center">
            <div class="mr-3">
              <FaRocket />
            </div>
            Our Mission
          </h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            To combine advanced laboratory science with efficient service to meet everyday
            healthcare needs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Core Values */}
    <section class="bg-[#01329C] text-white py-10 shadow-inner">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-wide">Our Core Values</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {
          coreValues.map(({ title, Icon, desc }) => (
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md border border-gray-100 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center text-[#01329C] text-2xl mb-6">
                <Icon />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">{title}</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">{desc}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Leadership Profile */}
    <section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#01329C] inline-block relative">
          Meet Our Leadership
          <span
            class="absolute -bottom-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-16 h-1 bg-[#01329C] rounded-full"
          ></span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-center">
          <div
            class="relative w-64 h-64 md:w-80 md:h-80 lg:w-full lg:h-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl mb-8 group"
          >
            <img
              src="/dr_ephraim.png"
              alt="Dr. Ephraim Ogbaini-Emovon"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
            />
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center lg:text-left w-full">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Dr. Ephraim Ogbaini-Emovon</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">
              FMCPath, MBBS, MPH, CPF (UK)
            </p>
            <div class="h-px w-full bg-gray-200 my-4"></div>
            <p class="text-[#01329C] font-bold text-lg">Founder & Chief Executive Officer</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium mt-1">Express Clinical Laboratory</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Global LabConnect (GLC)</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed">
          <blockquote class="relative p-6 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-[#01329C] mb-8">
            <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-4xl text-blue-200 font-serif leading-none">
              "
            </span>
            <p class="relative z-10 italic text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 ml-4">
              Strong laboratories are the foundation of quality healthcare, resilient health
              systems, and global health security.
            </p>
          </blockquote>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <p>
              Dr. Ephraim Ogbaini-Emovon is a distinguished Pathologist, Laboratory Physician,
              Consultant Medical Microbiologist, and Clinical Research Scientist with more than two
              decades of experience in diagnostic medicine, laboratory systems strengthening,
              biosafety and biosecurity, outbreak preparedness, infection prevention and control,
              clinical research, and public health.
            </p>
            <p>
              A Fellow of the National Postgraduate Medical College of Nigeria and recipient of the
              prestigious Commonwealth Professional Fellowship (United Kingdom), he has established
              an outstanding record of leadership in laboratory medicine and infectious disease
              control at national and international levels.
            </p>
            <p>
              He previously served as Director of the Institute for Viral and Emergent Pathogens
              Control and Research, Irrua Specialist Teaching Hospital, where he led the
              establishment of one of Nigeria's foremost Biosafety Level 3 molecular diagnostic and
              research laboratories, significantly strengthening the country's capacity for
              infectious disease diagnosis, surveillance, and clinical research.
            </p>
            <p>
              Dr. Ogbaini-Emovon has played strategic roles in Nigeria's response to Lassa fever,
              Ebola Virus Disease, and COVID-19. During the COVID-19 pandemic, he chaired the
              Nigerian Medical Association Outbreak Response Team in Edo State and later served on
              the National Isolation Centre Assessment and Accreditation Committee constituted by
              the Federal Ministry of Health. He has also contributed to numerous national technical
              working groups involving the World Health Organization (WHO), Nigeria Centre for
              Disease Control (NCDC), AFENET, and the Federal Ministry of Health, supporting policy
              development, laboratory strengthening, and emergency preparedness.
            </p>
            <p>
              Internationally, he has served as a Clinical Fellow at the Rare and Imported Pathogens
              Laboratory and the National Microbiology Reference Laboratory in England and as a
              World Health Organization consultant supporting laboratory strengthening and outbreak
              preparedness initiatives in Liberia and South Sudan. He currently serves as Faculty
              Member of the Georgetown University Lassa Fever Case Management Fellowship Programme.
              Dr. Ephraim Ogbaini-Emovon has received Awards of Excellent from the NMA, the Nigeria
              Centre for Disease Control (NCDC) and was honoured with a commendation from the United
              States Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (US CDC) in recognition of his
              contributions to global health.
            </p>
            <p>
              An accomplished researcher with more than 60 peer-reviewed scientific publications,
              Dr. Ogbaini-Emovon has led several landmark initiatives, including the development of
              the first WHO International Lassa Virus Antibody Standard and the establishment of
              Nigeria's first hospital-based infectious disease biobank, advancing diagnostics,
              translational research, and global health security.
            </p>
            <p>
              He holds Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) and Master of Public Health
              (MPH) degrees from the University of Benin and Postgraduate Certificate in Clinical
              Trials from the University of London. He has undertaken advanced professional training
              in Outbreak Response, Project Management, Advanced Diagnostics, and Biobanking through
              leading institutions in the United Kingdom and France.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
